# Public tree allow-list. Keep local experiments, audit evidence and handoffs private.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/README.md
!/文档/
!/构建脚本/

/文档/*
!/文档/仓库使用与验证边界.md
!/文档/V3.1路线图.md

/构建脚本/*
!/构建脚本/v3/
/构建脚本/v3/*
!/构建脚本/v3/v3_026/

# Generated build outputs and signing/authentication secrets are never public inputs.
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.apk
*.aab
*.dex
*.odex
*.vdex
*.oat
*.art
*.so
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar
*.gz
*.log
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
.env
.env.*
id_rsa
id_ed25519
**/session.json
**/build_result.json
**/build_input.json
**/candidate_identity.json
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
